Description: userspace camera ISP for the Lenovo Yoga Book YB1-X91L
 Provides raw Bayer capture, demosaic, denoising, color correction, adaptive
 exposure/white-balance policy and a browser-compatible V4L2 camera for the
 front OV2740 and rear OV8858 sensors in the Lenovo Yoga Book YB1-X91L.
